---
title: Text tools
tags: tools
heading: "Tools"
summary: >-
    Runs common operations on text, such as stripping spaces or removing numbers.
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
    <p>To run several tools in a row, use "Move to input" to bring the output back into the input, then run the next tool: strip spaces, move the result to the input, then run Remove all numbers. Keep spaces and line breaks only works on tools marked with an asterisk [*]: it keeps spaces, tabs and new lines, so each line stays on its own. Without it, those tools remove them all.</p>
    <p>Letters include accented letters and other alphabets (é, ß, Ж), and numbers include other numerals (², ½). Everything else, including emoji, is a special character. Letters to alphabet number takes accents off, so é is 5, and leaves out letters outside A to Z.</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Text tools", actions = [{ id: filename + "Run", label: "Run" }]) %}
<div class="tool-field">
    <label class="tool-field__label" for="{{ filename }}Select">Tool</label>
    <select class="form-select" id="{{ filename }}Select" autocomplete="off">
        <option value="stripspaces" selected="">Strip spaces</option>
        <option value="stripallwhitespace">Strip all whitespace</option>
        <option value="reverse">Reverse</option>
        <option value="uppercase">Uppercase</option>
        <option value="lowercase">Lowercase</option>
        <option value="uppercaseonly">Uppercase only *</option>
        <option value="lowercaseonly">Lowercase only *</option>
        <option value="numbersonly">Numbers only *</option>
        <option value="lettersonly">Letters only *</option>
        <option value="specialcharsonly">Special characters only *</option>
        <option value="removenumbers">Remove all numbers</option>
        <option value="removeletters">Remove all letters</option>
        <option value="stripspecialchars">Remove all special characters *</option>
        <option value="alphabet">Letters to alphabet number</option>
        <option value="unique">Unique characters</option>
        <option value="urlencode">URL Encode</option>
        <option value="urldecode">URL Decode</option>
    </select>
</div>
<div class="form-check form-switch">
    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="{{ filename }}PreserveWhitespace">
    <label class="form-check-label" for="{{ filename }}PreserveWhitespace">Keep spaces and line breaks *</label>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
